Allows you to burrow into earthen walls for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

Your powerful digging abilities also allow you to exploit and smash through enemy defensive weaknesses; You ignore [26, 32, 37, 40, 44 (TL1-5; MP 100)] of target armor and [13%, 16%, 18%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5; MP 100)] of enemy physical damage resistance while this is in effect.

At Talent Level 5, this talent can be used instantly, and the cooldown will reduce with levels.

Each point in sand drake talents also increases your physical resistance by 0.5%.
